  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Budget Ledger",
    "overview": "ERP Estrada reads like a well-kept ledger: white paper, ruled lines, figures aligned and exact. It is an Operate surface used at office desktops during the budget cycle and payment runs, so density and scanability come first. Colour is rationed: Estrada Indigo marks the brand and the action to take, and every other hue says something specific (approval state, P&L category, company entity).\n\nComponents are quiet and flat. Hairline borders and pale indigo tints separate things; shadows are barely there and only overlays lift. Light, dark and follow-system themes share one token set.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Exact rupiah in tabular figures with a slashed zero",
      "Hairline rules and tonal fills before shadows",
      "Three meaning families: state, category, entity",
      "One typeface, four hierarchy steps, nothing under 12px",
      "Every screen fits a phone without sideways page scroll"
    ],
    "rules": [
